</div><div id="inner_content-2-11" class="ct-inner-content"><section id="section-2-48" class=" ct-section c-hero-xs"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h2 id="headline-3-48" class="ct-headline c-h1 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Careers at QT' Kitchen</h2></div></section><section id="section-8-48" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h2 id="headline-9-48" class="ct-headline c-h2 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">We're a Vibrant Vietnamese restaurant in the heart of Glen iris and we're always looking for talented people to join our team.</h2><div id="text_block-10-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-l c-margin-bottom-l c-text-light">QT Kitchen is a modern 90 seat Vietnamese fusion restaurant on High St in the leafy suburb of Glen Iris. Inspired by the world's best produce here in Australia, the team love putting a modern spin on Vietnamese &amp; Thai favourites, taking guests on a gastronomic journey through Asia's favourite foodie hotspots.&nbsp;<br><br>Service with a smile &amp; a fully licensed bar to match, it's truly a hidden gem that diners come to experience from all areas of greater Melbourne.<br><br>We're always on the look out for:<br><b><br>Front Of House Team Members<br>Kitchen Hand</b><br><b>Cooks<br>Baristas</b><br><br>Fill out the form below and our General Manager will reach out if there's a current opening.<br></div><div id="shortcode-94-174" class="ct-shortcode"><div class="wpforms-container wpforms-container-full" id="wpforms-175"><form id="wpforms-form-175" class="wpforms-validate wpforms-form wpforms-ajax-form" data-formid="175" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/careers-at-qt-kitchen/" data-token="59e4c5e2ad308dff57b577ec46a8c52a" novalidate="novalidate"><noscript class="wpforms-error-noscript">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.</noscript><div class="wpforms-field-container"><div id="wpforms-175-field_0-container" class="wpforms-field wpforms-field-name" data-field-id=